  "visibleText": "Home About Us Photo Gallery Tour Packages Contact Us Connect Us For Booking : +91 0422 2443533 +91 0422 2433544 Quick Enquiry Welcome to Karthik Travels Karthik Travels was founded on 1985. With 30 years of successful business by making our customers happy and satisfied, we are marching ahead to explore new horizons by the goodwill and reputation that we have garnered so far in this service. The company is sphere-headed by our Managing Director Mr.R.Paarthasarathy (Vijayan), under his able guidance, we are striving to bring the best from us and to make our customer pleased and fulfilled. Tour Packages Photo Gallery Contact Us Chemical House, Old No: 18 - New No: 24, Bharathi park 4th Cross Street, Near BSNL Office, Saibaba Colony, Coimbatore - 641 011, Tamilnadu, INDIA. P : +91 0422 2443533, 2433544, 2445338 M : +91 94431 33465 E : info@karthiktravels.in © 2015 - Karthik Travels / All Righst Reserved",
